==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 15

==Battleground==
*2 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Crocodylidae Kurocroc]] spawns as the boss after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Brollow]]s spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] spawns.
**2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Zollow]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since all the hard stuff is on a timer, your first priority is killing Rangmaster before Kurocroc spawns: with both on screen, it becomes extremely hard for you to win. [[Barrel Cat]] and [[Cat Cactus]] are both Surge Immune and work for the Rangmaster, while units like [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] can take advantage of the Aku Doges to snipe the Brollows and Zollows. Once Rangmaster's dead, it becomes a standard Kurocroc cleanup that you can use your counters from the previous stage to deal with.

